#: ../../source/install.rst:38
msgid ""
"Small Python scripts for visualizing phonon dispersion relations, phonon DOS,"
" etc. are provided; they require the Python packages listed above. "
"Additionally, XcrySDen is necessary to visualize the normal-mode directions "
"and animate the normal modes. VMD may be more convenient for making "
"animations, but any other visualization software that supports the XYZ format"
" can be used instead."
